comment0.text=\n\ This\ class\ defines\ an\ enumeration\ of\ all\ valid\ command\ words\ for\ the\ game.\n\ It\ is\ used\ to\ recognize\ commands\ as\ they\ are\ typed\ in.\ \ The\ commands\ are\n\ case-insensitive.\n\n\ @author\ Michael\ K\u00F6lling,\ David\ J.\ Barnes,\ and\ Ayan\ Mamun\n\ @version\ 2024.11.28\n
