comment2.target=boolean\ isCommand(java.lang.String)
comment2.text=\n\ Check\ whether\ a\ given\ String\ is\ a\ valid\ command\ word.\n\ @param\ aWord\ The\ word\ to\ check.\n\ @return\ true\ if\ the\ word\ is\ a\ valid\ command,\ false\ otherwise.\n
